Subtask 3.6: Configure Sampling Strategies
Optimize trace collection with sampling strategies.

# Create sampling configuration
cat <<EOF | kubectl apply -f -
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: jaeger-sampling-configuration
  namespace: istio-system
data:
  sampling_strategies.json: |
    {
      "service_strategies": [
        {
          "service": "productpage.bookinfo",
          "type": "probabilistic",
          "param": 1.0
        },
        {
          "service": "reviews.bookinfo",
          "type": "probabilistic",
          "param": 0.5
        }
      ],
      "default_strategy": {
        "type": "probabilistic",
        "param": 0.1
      }
    }
EOF
Update Jaeger configuration to use sampling strategies:

# Update Jaeger instance with sampling configuration
kubectl patch jaeger jaeger-small-production -n istio-system --type='merge' -p='{"spec":{"sampling":{"options":{"configmap":"jaeger-sampling-configuration"}}}}'
